              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Jon 13.20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Dano mo ma ojolo latin acel macalo man pi nyiŋa, meno rom ki ma ojolo an; ka dok dano ma ojolo an, meno rom ki ma ojolo ŋat muora-ni.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.37",
