        },
        {
          "text": "Jon owaco bot Yecu ni, “Lapwony, waneno ŋatti mo ka tye ka ryemo cen ki nyiŋi, ma en pe nywako wot kwedwa, ci wajuke woko.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
