          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento Yecu ogamo ni, “Pe wujuke; pien pe tye dano mo ma tiyo tic matek ki nyiŋa, ma twero waco lok mo marac i koma oyot. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
