                  "text": "Mat 5.30",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ka ce ciŋi aye omiyo ipoto i bal, ci toŋ iŋun woko, twara ma idonyo i kwo ma ciŋi lakucel peke, ber makato ma giboli i Geena ma itye ki ciŋi aryo ducu, kun idonyo kwedgi i mac ma pe to, [ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
